--Description: 
-- Thinking process:
-- • Objective: Divide all taxi trips whose "trip_seconds" are between 1 – 3 600 (0 – 60 min) 
--   into six equal-frequency duration buckets, then report for each bucket:
--     – minimum trip length (rounded minutes)
--     – maximum trip length (rounded minutes)
--     – total number of trips
